"supported."
msgstr ""
"As instantáneas de BTRFS gárdanse na partición do sistema. Non se admiten "
"outras particións."

#: src/Gtk/FinishBox.vala:92
msgid ""
"BTRFS snapshots are saved on the same disk from which it is created. If the "
"system disk fails, snapshots will be lost along with the system. Save "
"snapshots to an external non-system disk in RSYNC mode to guard against disk "
"failures."
msgstr ""
"As instantáneas de BTRFS gárdanse no mesmo disco no que se crean. Se falla o "
"disco do sistema, as instantáneas perderanse xunto co sistema. Para "
"protexerse contra posibles fallos do disco, garde as instantáneas nun disco "
"externo distinto do disco do sistema, utilizando o modo RSYNC."

